    "91-120 days": "emisi 91-120",
    "A feature that is switched off is refused by the app: the work it belongs to cannot be done until the feature is back on.": "Ekikwata ekikyalidde kikakyalwa n'eky programu: mulimu gikwatagana nako tekekola nga tekinneera okumala nga ekikwata kikaba ku muliro.",
    "A key moves your account onto the plan it was issued for.": "Ekikikwata kikisoboka akaunti y'ako ku pulani gyaakuleetwa.",
    "A lead starts at the beginning of the pipeline. Where it goes from here is decided afterwards.": "Omukasa gutandika mu ntandikwa y'ekimuli. Ekyo okujja kikigendererwa mu maa ga.",
    "A name is required.": "Erinnya lirina.",
    "A newly registered device has never been seen working — a person has to confirm it before it counts as verified.": "Ekikoreso ekisoonjwadde bwe kikola terabikidde — muntu alina okukikubale nga tannanyini okuba tennyalidde.",
    "A note on this line": "Ekyaliimo ku mulongo guno",
    "A payment is not a payment until it has been confirmed against the provider&apos;s own record. The amount here must match what the provider shows.": "Ensimbi terabweru ensimbi nga tezaaliyootwaliddwa n'ekikalu ky'omutwala. Kiwendererwa kino kinaweera okuba nga kikwatagana n'eko omutwala alaba.",
    "A payment that has gone past its date": "Ensimbi ezirenze olunaku lwayo",
    "A phone number is required.": "Namba ya simu erina.",
    "A price change applies to the next period. What existing subscribers pay is already recorded on their subscription.": "Enkyukakyuka y'emutengo ekikola ku kiseera kikisooka. Eky'abasajja baliwo bazungwa kuliiso ku buli obwandika bwabwe.",
    "A quotation needs at least one line.": "Omulando gumu erina okuba n'oburongo bumala.",
    "A receipt, a dispense and a write-off take a positive amount. An adjustment that reduces the register takes a negative one.": "Risiti, okutunda n'okusubiramo gzikwata kiwendererwa kik positively. Olulunguso olukyeggyanga olukaluuka kikwata kiwendererwa k-negative.",
    "A reference can only be used once — it stops a double payment.": "Olunaku lw'okuraba lulimaze kukozesa buli kaseera — lwaga malipo gabiri.",
    "A reference records the payment for checking. It does not confirm it — that is the provider&apos;s word to give.": "Olunaku lw'okuraba lumuuka okutandika malipo okukebera. Tewali kukitandika — eyo omutwala ye mugya.",
    "A reservation made here appears in this list, and so does every guest who walks in.": "Obubufumba bubakozese ku wano bulaba ku lulimi luno, era nga bwe buli mukibi ajja nga buta.",
    "A restore adds the rows in the file to this business. It does not remove anything, and it does not overwrite a row that is already here — so restore into a business you are happy to add to.": "Okuzoola kuuma okuyongerako engeri eziri mu kigendererwa mu bizinessi kino. Tekikyola kintu, era tekikubikira engeri esabula eno — kwa kino zoola mu bizinessi oyotola okuyongerako.",
    "A revoked session cannot be used again, even if its access token has not yet expired.": "Emisumpera esulwawo tekizoola kuuseda, nga bwe bweerali tekyali mukattu.",
    "A run is opened, worked out, approved and then paid.": "Omusumpera gufuluka, guhesabiwa, gwaalanyizwa era gubalwa.",
    "A stable id for this device": "ID ekikwata ennywe eri ekikoreso kino",
    "A value is saved. It is encrypted and cannot be read back — only replaced.": "Engalo ekirikwa. Emfichidwa era tekisoboka okusoma kizzyo — kirundulwa fulye.",
    "A volume band or a customer's own price changes what the till charges. Add one when a customer agrees a price.": "Ennanga y'ekigendererwa oba mutengo g'omteekateeka gumu gukyesa kasa ekisoboka okutunda. Yoongeza kimwe omteekateeka asuubi og-agana.",
